WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.970
Two churches in Britain.

2
00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:03.970
Both read the same Bible.

3
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:08.330
In one, a Methodist church,
a same-sex couple may marry.

4
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:13.310
In the other, the Catholic Church,
marriage is only between a man and a woman.

5
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.880
Some priests must stay unmarried.

6
00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:19.600
Others may marry, but only
before they are ordained.

7
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:24.540
So if Christians share one Bible, why
do churches answer so differently about

8
00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:27.040
sex, marriage and gender?

9
00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:30.950
In this mission, you'll read the
texts at the centre of the debate.

10
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.270
Then you'll map where churches
in Britain stand today,

11
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:37.290
from celibacy to transgender questions.

12
00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:42.350
Your mission: find out why churches
answer so differently about sex,

13
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.810
marriage and gender.
